{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Neko Neko Love",
    "steam_appid": 3690560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/b2c773a7010d868265c892266c32cf3d.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=412 /></span><strong>Have you ever wanted to be a cat?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To eat, sleep and play without a care in the world? Well, wish granted in <strong>NEKO NEKO LOVE</strong>, a cozy fantasy visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <i>the cat</i>, an immortal creature inspired by Japanese folklore, who once swore never to bond with a new master after losing the last one. <i>The past leaves its marks\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, here you are\u2014lost on a new continent, you\u2019ll need to find shelter with a human before the terrifying <strong>Magic Storm</strong> descends upon the city.<br><i>Obviously, it couldn\u2019t be easy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forced by fate, your cat must grow closer (your choice!) to a <strong>perpetually broke student mage</strong>, a <strong>na\u00efve young witch</strong>, or a <strong>former mercenary turned gardener</strong>. <i>A dream cast, right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Following the tradition of romance games</strong>, you\u2019ll have to find your place in their daily lives before it\u2019s too late. <i>Feeling like Tom Cruise yet?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/ec35eb3c27e6246e044e914d32255c2f.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/615f08138b94a9769bd32a7303759d81.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through both <strong>small and major decisions</strong>, you\u2019ll <strong>shape your feline\u2019s personality</strong> as the story unfolds\u2014<br>Will your cat be wild or cuddly? Mischievous or serious?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/60a56f640ed581a7866f633f0f17c6a8.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a <strong>world where magic meets modern life</strong>, you\u2019ll discover a cast of realistic and endearing characters.<br>Struggles with <strong>anxiety</strong>, the search for <strong>independence</strong>, <strong>financial trouble</strong>\u2026 sound familiar?<br>Not for the cat! he need to learn some <strong>empathy</strong> to win over their <i>Meow Interests</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/c5aaad63ffb8ab36d352b480a9a5801e.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love games with soul? So do we. <strong>Neko Neko Love</strong> features a unique art style inspired by <strong>paper theater and <i>kamishiba</i></strong><i>i</i>, offering a look that\u2019s both delicate and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find a magical world where <strong>Japanese and European influences come together beautifully</strong>. <br>Every background and character is lovingly hand-drawn\u2014no AI involved\u2014to preserve the <strong>warmth and authenticity of art</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/386123d4e7a781a1e32ef25848bbcdf0.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close your eyes and let yourself drift with <strong>dreamy lofi</strong>, <strong>mysterious jazz</strong>, or <strong>heartfelt fantasy melodies</strong>.<br>Okay, open them back up\u2014you\u2019ve got some reading to do.<br>The soundtrack is designed to <strong>immerse you without pulling your focus</strong>. Amazing, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/0fb086efc6e6f2effd8060cd71b9f27b.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small team on a mission to bring <strong>beauty, emotion, and originality back to visual novels</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Neko Neko Love</strong>, you\u2019re adding a little magic to your everyday life\u2026 and to ours.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/b2c773a7010d868265c892266c32cf3d.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=412 /></span><strong>Have you ever wanted to be a cat?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To eat, sleep and play without a care in the world? Well, wish granted in <strong>NEKO NEKO LOVE</strong>, a cozy fantasy visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <i>the cat</i>, an immortal creature inspired by Japanese folklore, who once swore never to bond with a new master after losing the last one. <i>The past leaves its marks\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, here you are\u2014lost on a new continent, you\u2019ll need to find shelter with a human before the terrifying <strong>Magic Storm</strong> descends upon the city.<br><i>Obviously, it couldn\u2019t be easy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forced by fate, your cat must grow closer (your choice!) to a <strong>perpetually broke student mage</strong>, a <strong>na\u00efve young witch</strong>, or a <strong>former mercenary turned gardener</strong>. <i>A dream cast, right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Following the tradition of romance games</strong>, you\u2019ll have to find your place in their daily lives before it\u2019s too late. <i>Feeling like Tom Cruise yet?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/ec35eb3c27e6246e044e914d32255c2f.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/615f08138b94a9769bd32a7303759d81.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=163 /></span>