re_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/386123d4e7a781a1e32ef25848bbcdf0.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close your eyes and let yourself drift with <strong>dreamy lofi</strong>, <strong>mysterious jazz</strong>, or <strong>heartfelt fantasy melodies</strong>.<br>Okay, open them back up\u2014you\u2019ve got some reading to do.<br>The soundtrack is designed to <strong>immerse you without pulling your focus</strong>. Amazing, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690560/extras/0fb086efc6e6f2effd8060cd71b9f27b.avif?t=1749322556\" width=800 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small team on a mission to bring <strong>beauty, emotion, and originality back to visual novels</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Neko Neko Love</strong>, you\u2019re adding a little magic to your everyday life\u2026 and to ours.</p>",
